context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/queues/{queue_id}
Deletes a queue
Required: queue_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/queues/{queue_id}/consumers/{consumer_id}
Deletes the consumer for a queue.
Required: consumer_id (path); queue_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/queues/{queue_id}
Get details about a specific queue.
Required: queue_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/queues/{queue_id}/consumers/{consumer_id}
Fetches the consumer for a queue by consumer id
Required: consumer_id (path); queue_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/queues/{queue_id}/consumers/{consumer_id}
Updates the consumer for a queue, or creates one if it does not exist.
Required: consumer_id (path); queue_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
